{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國西北大學工程師開發出一種名為「直接墨水增材光刻」的新型3D打印技術，簡稱DIAL。該技術將光固化打印的速度與精度，以及擠出式打印的材料兼容性結合在一起，能夠快速製造結構精細、材料多樣的複雜三維物體，並有望應用於柔性機械人、醫療器件、航空航天結構、先進電池和組織工程等領域。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587270.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.499529+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:35:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:15.226288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:15.226288+00:00","content_hash":"61d4b95dac7bea75794c04e99117cfcaf37c1abf18643fd6214952420be8c181","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}